{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26024","headline":"长安言怀 · 鲍溶","name":"长安言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殷殷生念厚，戚戚劳者多。\n二时昼夜等，百岁讵几何。\n日下文翰苑，侧身识经过。\n千虑恐一失，翔阳已蹉跎。\n临觞翦衆忧，静寄丝桐歌。\n思归绕十指，五声不相和。\n暮天还巢翼，明日陨叶柯。\n高谢岩谷人，鹿衣带女萝。\n生不去亲爱，浮名若风波。\n谁令不及此，亲爱隔山河。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}